    text  "具有可批处理和由 DreamGUICanvas 渲染的渲染几何体的 UI 元素。"
    state machine
}

DreamVisualBatchMesh:BlendMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamVisualBatchMesh.h#DreamVisualBatchMesh:BlendMode
    src   "How this element composites into what is already drawn. Honoured by DreamGUI's built-in shader;\nan element with a material of its own composites the way that material says, and this then only\ntakes part in the batching decision.\n        // In the Layer section of the widget's details, with its opacity and mask, rather than with the visual's own rows."
    text  "此元素如何与已绘制的内容混合。DreamGUI的内置着色器会遵循此设置；\n拥有自身材质的元素按该材质的方式混合，此时该设置只\n参与合批决策。\n        // 位于控件细节的层部分，与其不透明度和遮罩一起，而不是在视觉自身的行中。"
    state machine
}

DreamVisualBatchMesh:MarkVerticesDirty {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamVisualBatchMesh.h#DreamVisualBatchMesh:MarkVerticesDirty
    src   "Mark vertices dirty, then DreamGUI will trigger UpdateGeometry process, and OnUpdateGeometry will execute in next render update.\nCall this if you want to update vertex data.\nFor blueprint easily use."
    text  "将顶点标记为脏，随后DreamGUI会触发UpdateGeometry流程，OnUpdateGeometry将在下一次渲染更新时执行。\n如需更新顶点数据，请调用此函数。\n便于蓝图使用。"
    state machine
}

